// the uncut land: level at the lip; east of x 90 it rises 0.11 a metre (the fold eased over 8 m) as far as x 190, where the
// flight and every body are; beyond that THE HILL steepens to 0.28 a metre by x 370 and rounds over a crest 74 m above the lip
