    // stride; a row of stubs has gaps; the earth east of each row lies in the stubs' shade while the footprint
    // shows a row; and the whole field is a little lighter here and darker there over tens of metres)
    // (the rows show only while one is three footprints broad and more: finer, they wove a hatch with the pixels;
    // beyond that the stubble is COMBED, not ruled: streaks of thicker and thinner stubs along the drill's way, no two alike)
