  // or two across (fd_cracks: the seams between the cells of a wandering lattice of c metres, 1 in a seam; gone as the
  // footprint outgrows a plate); THE STUBBLE, the stalks' broken feet, pale, in knots along the drill rows where
  // the rows are still to be told (a knot by the place's own noise, never a lattice; it takes no neighbouring pixel's
