  // THE BEDS. A place's height in the beds' own frame: they dip gently to the east and the north and they roll a little;
  // NO FAULT THROWS THEM (round three b, the lead's ruling: the throw is gone here and from the builder's bedHAt alike)
  // (sines only, the same sum as the builder's bedHAt; the builder takes each corner's bed at this height where the
